WEBVTT

00:03.520 --> 00:06.800
Help me keep the Chen family and the Prince of Ning at bay.

00:10.520 --> 00:17.500
Fret not. Wan'er will support Your Majesty with all her might in ascending the dragon throne.

00:17.680 --> 00:23.800
If Your Majesty triumphs, Wan'er shall serve as the bridge reconciling Your Majesty with the southern aristocratic clans.

00:24.080 --> 00:35.840
And if Your Majesty loses... Wan'er is willing to share your fate as a doomed pair of mandarin ducks fleeing to the ends of the earth.

00:45.840 --> 00:53.000
The day after the wedding, you disguised yourself in the silk robes of the Chen clan's eldest daughter and slipped past the palace gates unnoticed.
